<%- include('partials/header', { page: 'careers' }) %>

    <!-- Main Container: Light Theme for consistency -->
    <div
        class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen pt-20 font-sans text-gray-600 relative selection:bg-brand-secondary selection:text-white">

        <!-- Hero Section: Dark & Cool ("Elite" Vibe) -->
        <div class="relative bg-brand-dark pt-16 pb-24 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Abstract Background Effects -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden z-0 pointer-events-none">
                <div
                    class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-blob">
                </div>
                <div
                    class="absolute top-[20%] right-[-10%] w-[35rem] h-[35rem] bg-brand-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-blob animation-delay-2000">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
                <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-7xl mb-6" data-aos="fade-down">
                    Únete a la <span
                        class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-secondary to-blue-400">Élite
                        Tecnológica</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed" data-aos="fade-up"
                    data-aos-delay="100">
                    Buscamos mentes brillantes que no se conforman con lo convencional. Desafía lo imposible en un
                    entorno de excelencia técnica.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center gap-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <a href="#openings"
                        class="btn-primary shadow-lg shadow-brand-primary/20 text-lg px-10 py-4 border-none">
                        Ver Posiciones
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Curve/Transition removed for cleaner look -->
        </div>

        <!-- Values Section (Grid of 3) -->
        <div class="relative z-10 py-20">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <!-- Value 1: Cultura de Aprendizaje -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 h-full flex flex-col"
                        data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
                                alt="Learning Culture"
                                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
                            <div
                                class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-primary/30 group-hover:bg-brand-primary/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-brand-primary shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket mr-1"></i> Crecimiento
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Cultura de Aprendizaje</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                Formación continua y certificaciones pagadas. Aprende nuevas tecnologías y metodologías
                                mientras trabajas en proyectos desafiantes.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Value 2: Flexibilidad Total -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 h-full flex flex-col"
                        data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593642532973-d31b6557fa68?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
                                alt="Remote Work"
                                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
                            <div
                                class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-primary/30 group-hover:bg-brand-primary/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-brand-primary shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas mr-1"></i> Remote-First
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Flexibilidad Total</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                Trabaja desde donde seas más productivo. Somos una empresa 100% remota con horarios
                                flexibles y conciliación real.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Value 3: Retos Técnicos -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 h-full flex flex-col"
                        data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
                                alt="Technical Challenges"
                                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
                            <div
                                class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-primary/30 group-hover:bg-brand-primary/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-brand-primary shadow-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code mr-1"></i> Innovación
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-8">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Retos Técnicos</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                Olvídate de la rutina. Resolverás problemas complejos de seguridad y arquitectura en
                                infraestructuras críticas.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Jobs Section -->
        <div id="openings" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-10">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-8 bg-brand-primary rounded-full mr-4"></span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-dark">Posiciones Abiertas</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="grid gap-6">
                <!-- Job Card 1 -->
                <div class="group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-primary/20"
                    data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                        <div class="flex-1">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <h3
                                    class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
                                    Senior Penetration Tester</h3>
                                <span
                                    class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-50 text-brand-primary rounded-full border border-blue-100">Híbrido</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-brand-secondary"></i> Madrid / Remoto
                                <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-gray-300 rounded-full"></span>
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-brand-secondary"></i> Tiempo Completo
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
                                Responsable de realizar auditorías de seguridad avanzadas (Web, Mobile, Infra) y Red
                                Teaming. Buscamos a alguien con certificaciones OSCP/OSWE o experiencia demostrable.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <a href="mailto:talento@fastcenter.eu?subject=Candidatura Senior Pentester"
                                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 border border-brand-primary text-brand-primary font-bold rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:text-brand-primary hover:bg-transparent">
                                Aplicar Ahora <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Job Card 2 -->
                <div class="group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-primary/20"
                    data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                        <div class="flex-1">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <h3
                                    class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
                                    Junior Pentester</h3>
                                <span
                                    class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full border border-green-100">Becas
                                    / Prácticas</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-brand-secondary"></i> 100% Remoto
                                <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-gray-300 rounded-full"></span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-brand-secondary"></i> Formación Incluida
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
                                ¿Te apasiona la ciberseguridad? Únete a nuestro programa de cantera. Aprenderás de los
                                mejores mientras participas en proyectos reales de auditoría.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <a href="mailto:talento@fastcenter.eu?subject=Candidatura Junior Pentester"
                                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 border border-brand-primary text-brand-primary font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-primary hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                                Aplicar Ahora <i
                                    class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Job Card 3 -->
                <div class="group relative bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-primary/20"
                    data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                        <div class="flex-1">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                                <h3
                                    class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
                                    Backend Developer (Node.js)</h3>
                                <span
                                    class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-50 text-brand-primary rounded-full border border-blue-100">Full
                                    Time</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-brand-secondary"></i> Remoto (España)
                                <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-gray-300 rounded-full"></span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-code text-brand-secondary"></i> Senior
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
                                Desarrollo de arquitecturas escalables, APIs RESTful seguras y microservicios. Stack
                                principal: Node.js, PostgreSQL, Docker, Redis.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <a href="mailto:talento@fastcenter.eu?subject=Candidatura Backend Dev"
                                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 border border-brand-primary text-brand-primary font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-primary hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                                Aplicar Ahora <i
                                    class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Spontaneous Application -->
            <div class="mt-20 text-center" data-aos="fadeIn">
                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-2xl px-10 py-12 border border-gray-100 shadow-lg inline-block w-full max-w-4xl">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-4">¿No encuentras tu posición?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                        Siempre estamos buscando talento excepcional. Si crees que puedes aportar valor a nuestro
                        equipo, ¡te queremos conocer!
                    </p>
                    <a href="mailto:talento@fastcenter.eu"
                        class="text-brand-primary font-bold text-xl transition-colors border-b-2 border-brand-primary/20 pb-1 inline-flex items-center">
                        Enviar CV Espontáneo <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane ml-2"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>